\subsubsection{Demographics}

Table \ref{tab:meDemog} shows the results of a mixed effect model.\footnote{To test the 
proper specification of the random effects terms, the parametric bootstrap of the 
likelihood ratio test was used to compare the mixed models. It showed that district 
effects alone improved model fit and no additional gain was made by including a 
random effect for years \citep{pbkrtest}. This was implemented in R using the 
\texttt{pbkrtest} package. Results and script available upon request. } 


